  causeName: Cuaca
  headline: "Tak Tahan Panas Malaysia,\nPancit Di Tengah Jalan"
  headlineEN: Unable to withstand Malaysian heat, collapses mid-road
  subhead: '"Dah tahu panas, kenapa tak bawa air? Soalan polis."'
  subheadEN: '"You knew it was hot. Why no water? Police are asking."'
  flavourText: "Ini adalah kematian ke-3 akibat panas terik minggu ini.\nJPN mohon rakyat sentiasa bawa payung."
